    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548720/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748223021\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demoness Shar, summoned by a group of girls who performed a fatrifice, wants to become even stronger! And how will she do that, you ask? That\u2019s a good question, by another fatrifice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548720/extras/a0397923b241d16f452b2eefeeacfed5.webp?t=1748223021\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the first Fatrifice game, but this time around, it\u2019s Lilith\u2019s turn. She\u2019s not doing it alone though, Delilah will be cooking the food for Lilith! There is also a shop to buy skills and different foods for her to eat! Help her expand into new shapes and sizes by cooking and feeding her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548720/extras/a0397923b241d16f452b2eefeeacfed5.webp?t=1748223021\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feeding minigame and a cooking minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and lovable story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shop to buy skills and different food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery to revisit you favorite moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to feel good about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless mode after completing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chubby chasing demoness. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548720/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748223021\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demoness Shar, summoned by a group of girls who performed a fatrifice, wants to become even stronger! And how will she do that, you ask? That\u2019s a good question, by another fatrifice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548720/extras/a0397923b241d16f452b2eefeeacfed5.webp?t=1748223021\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the first Fatrifice game, but this time around, it\u2019s Lilith\u2019s turn. She\u2019s not doing it alone though, Delilah will be cooking the food for Lilith! There is also a shop to buy skills and different foods for her to eat! Help her expand into new shapes and sizes by cooking and feeding her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548720/extras/a0397923b241d16f452b2eefeeacfed5.webp?t=1748223021\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A feeding minigame and a cooking minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and lovable story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shop to buy skills and different food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery to revisit you favorite moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to feel good about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless mode after completing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chubby chasing demoness. </p></li></ul>",
